Upstream Attribution & Scientific Acknowledgements:
- Conceptual inspiration for continuous coordination-geometry representations in machine learning from CoordRep by Wen-Lin Luo and Cheng-Hui Li (https://github.com/1701NJU/CoordRep, MIT License, 2026).
- Covalent radii table via ASE (Hjorth Larsen et al., 2017) derived from Cordero et al., Dalton Trans. 2008, 2832-2838.
- All periodic donor priors, chelating carboxylate-C filtering (v2), high-CN polyhedral templates (CN=7,8,9), exact symmetry-quotient Procrustes reduction (S_N / G_{O(3)}), and 3x3 analytical singular-value kernels (v3) in this repository are independent implementations.
